---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for the by3DXYZ shop.">
  <section class="wrap page-hero prose">
    <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      This page explains what the shop collects when you visit, write, or pay. There are no customer accounts on this
      site.
    </p>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      If you use the contact form, your email app sends the message to {site.email}. Custom requests on the
      <a href="/custom">custom page</a> go to the same shop inbox as paid-order notices. The footer shows a public
      visit total. That number is a count only, not your name, email, or order details.
    </p>
    <h2>Checkout</h2>
    <p>
      Payments on this site go through PayPal. Card details are handled by PayPal, not by our servers. After payment,
      the shop receives the SKU, selected options (color, size), quantity, and the ship-to address PayPal collected, so
      the order can be printed and mailed. See PayPal’s privacy policy for details.
    </p>
    <p>
      Purchases on Etsy follow Etsy’s policies: <a href={site.etsyUrl}>{site.etsyUrl}</a>
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and ads</h2>
    <p>
      PayPal may set cookies on its checkout page. This site does not run its own shopping-cart cookies, and it does
      not run ads.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{site.email}</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
